+      "id": "US-966",
+      "title": "Implement OWASP LLM06 â€” vector store access control and embedding partitioning",
       "priority": "high",
-      "description": "Rainbow's traces config stores spans in the DB (backend: db) but does not emit structured OpenTelemetry spans conforming to the GenAI Semantic Conventions (v1.37+). Without standard spans, the system cannot be connected to any OTEL-compatible backend (Grafana, Datadog, Jaeger) for latency analysis, cost attribution per provider, or cross-request tracing. Adding OTEL instrumentation using the GenAI semantic conventions would give observable, interoperable telemetry without changing the existing DB trace store.",
+      "description": "OWASP LLM06:2025 (Vector and Embedding Weaknesses) requires fine-grained access controls on vector databases to prevent cross-tenant data leakage, embedding inversion attacks, and similarity attacks that retrieve unintended content. Rainbow AI serves two properties (Pelangi and Southern) with separate knowledge bases but potentially shared vector infrastructure â€” without logical partitioning, a query for one property could retrieve embeddings from the other.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "Each AI provider call emits an OTEL CLIENT span with gen_ai.system, gen_ai.request.model, gen_ai.usage.input_tokens, gen_ai.usage.output_tokens, and gen_ai.response.finish_reasons attributes",
-        "Span name follows the format '{gen_ai.operation.name} {gen_ai.request.model}'",
-        "An OTEL exporter endpoint is configurable via OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT env var; when unset, traces are no-op (no external dependency)",
-        "Provider fallover spans are linked via trace context so the full retry chain is visible as a single trace",
-        "Promptfoo evals can optionally emit spans for eval runs"
+        "Vector store queries are scoped by a `property_id` (or `namespace`) tag so Pelangi KB embeddings are never returned in response to Southern queries and vice versa",
+        "Embedding retrieval requires an authenticated service identity; unauthenticated or cross-tenant queries return a 403 and are logged",
+        "Vector DB access logs (query, retrieved doc IDs, scores) are retained for 90 days and accessible in the admin audit trail",
+        "Routine quarterly audit script verifies no cross-namespace vectors exist in the store",
+        "Similarity attack mitigation: queries returning unusually high-score matches to out-of-namespace documents trigger an alert"
       ],
       "technicalNotes": [
-        "OpenTelemetry GenAI Semantic Conventions v1.37 define gen_ai.* span attributes (https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/semconv/gen-ai/gen-ai-spans/)",
-        "Use @opentelemetry/sdk-node + @opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http packages",
