-        "Event records older than the configured retention_days are purged by the existing retention job",
-        "When more than 3 injection attempts are detected from the same JID within 1 hour, a staff WhatsApp alert is sent",
-        "Original message text is stored PII-redacted (using the existing piiRedaction pipeline) before DB write"
+        "After each RAG or KB-assisted LLM call, a groundedness score (0.0–1.0) is computed by checking each factual claim in the response against the retrieved context chunks",
+        "Responses scoring below a configurable groundedness_threshold (default 0.6) are blocked and the system falls back to the static KB answer or escalation message",
+        "Groundedness scores are stored alongside existing trace spans for analytics",
+        "Admin dashboard shows a histogram of groundedness scores over time",
+        "The groundedness check adds < 200 ms to response time (use a small, fast model or deterministic heuristic)"
       ],
