-      "id": "US-1001",
-      "title": "Drizzle ORM row-level security enforcement for tenant_id columns",
-      "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Rainbow supports multiple profiles that share the same PostgreSQL database, but tenant isolation currently relies on application-layer filtering (WHERE profile_id = ?). If a query forgets the profile_id filter â€” a common developer error â€” data from one profile leaks into another. Enabling PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS) on all tenant-scoped tables and setting a runtime app.current_tenant variable before each query provides a defence-in-depth guard that enforces isolation at the database layer, complementing but not replacing the application-layer filters.",
+      "id": "US-994",
+      "title": "Malaysia PDPA 2024: biometric data classification guard for passport/IC OCR",
+      "priority": "high",
