+      "description": "Build a server-side WhatsApp Flows data-exchange endpoint for a digital guest check-in form, handling Meta's RSA-OAEP + AES-128-GCM encrypted payloads. The endpoint processes screen transitions (INIT â†’ personal details â†’ ID upload â†’ T&Cs â†’ confirmation) with server-side validation at each step against the property's booking database, replacing the current unstructured text check-in flow.",
