-      "description": "OWASP API7:2023 (Server-Side Request Forgery) is newly listed in the 2023 API Security Top 10, driven by the proliferation of webhooks. Rainbow AI's admin panel allows webhook URL registration for payment callbacks, n8n automations, and WhatsApp delivery receipts. An attacker who controls a webhook URL can force the server to request internal cloud metadata endpoints (e.g. AWS instance metadata at 169.254.169.254), exfiltrating IAM credentials.",
