+      "id": "US-987",
+      "title": "Implement Malaysia PDPA data minimisation controls in AI prompt construction",
       "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Rainbow AI uses markdown knowledge base files in .rainbow-kb/ and .rainbow-kb-southern/ that are manually updated. In production, stale KB content causes AI hallucinations where the bot quotes outdated room rates, menu prices, or policies. There is no mechanism to detect when source documents are out of date or alert an admin that re-ingestion is needed. This is distinct from the existing 'LLM response faithfulness check' which validates answers at inference time â€” this story addresses upstream data freshness.",
+      "description": "Malaysia's PDPA Section 6 (Collection Principle) requires that personal data collected and processed be adequate but not excessive relative to the stated purpose. Rainbow AI currently passes full guest profiles and conversation histories to AI providers for every intent, including unrelated fields. Implementing a per-intent PII allowlist that strips irrelevant data before LLM calls reduces compliance exposure and shrinks the blast radius of any AI provider data incident.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "Each KB document has a last_verified_at timestamp stored in the rainbow_kb_files table",
-        "A configurable staleness threshold (default: 30 days) triggers an alert to the admin WhatsApp when any KB file has not been verified within that period",
-        "Admin can mark a KB file as 'verified' via the admin UI, resetting the staleness timer",
-        "When a KB file is updated on disk, the system automatically re-ingests (re-embeds) it within 1 hour",
-        "Staleness summary is included in the automated daily chatbot performance summary"
+        "A per-intent PII allowlist config (JSON file) specifies which data fields may be included in prompts for each intent class",
+        "AI prompt construction strips fields not in the allowlist for the current intent (e.g., passport number is not sent for a menu enquiry)",
+        "Prohibited PII fields (NRIC, passport numbers, full bank account numbers) are replaced with [REDACTED] in all prompts regardless of intent",
+        "An audit log records which PII fields were included in each AI provider call",
+        "Unit tests verify that minimisation rules are applied correctly per intent with no regression"
       ],
       "technicalNotes": [
-        "Store last_verified_at and last_modified_at in rainbow_kb_files table (already exists per CLAUDE.md)",
-        "File watcher (chokidar) or a cron job can detect mtime changes and enqueue re-ingestion",
-        "Reference: https://introl.com/blog/rag-infrastructure-production-retrieval-augmented-generation-guide"
-      ],
-      "dependencies": [
-        "LLM response faithfulness check: flag answers that contradict the knowledge base",
