+      "id": "US-998",
+      "title": "Structured prompt injection audit log with admin review queue",
       "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "Meta's July 2025 pricing update added a new pricing_type sub-field to delivery receipt webhook status events indicating how a delivered message was billed (marketing, utility, authentication, service, or free). The existing cost tracker tallies estimated costs based on template category at send time but cannot reconcile against Meta's actual billed category, which may differ. Ingesting pricing_type from status webhooks enables accurate cost reconciliation.",
+      "description": "The promptInjection setting detects injection attempts and returns a safe response, but detected events are not surfaced in the admin dashboard or stored with the original malicious content for security review. OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025) lists prompt injection as the #1 risk for LLM applications. An admin-accessible audit log of blocked injection attempts — with the original message text, detection pattern matched, timestamp, and JID — enables security monitoring, pattern refinement, and incident response.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "The webhook status handler extracts pricing.pricing_type and pricing.billable from delivered message status events",
-        "The extracted pricing_type is stored against the message record in rainbow_messages",
-        "The cost dashboard shows both estimated cost (from send-time category) and actual billed category (from pricing_type); discrepancies are flagged",
-        "A monthly reconciliation report is available in admin UI showing total messages per actual billed category"
+        "Every blocked prompt injection attempt is persisted to a dedicated prompt_injection_events table with: jid, profile_id, original_message_text, matched_pattern, timestamp, and action_taken",
+        "Admin dashboard has a 'Security' tab showing a paginated list of injection events with filtering by date and profile",
+        "Event records older than the configured retention_days are purged by the existing retention job",
+        "When more than 3 injection attempts are detected from the same JID within 1 hour, a staff WhatsApp alert is sent",
+        "Original message text is stored PII-redacted (using the existing piiRedaction pipeline) before DB write"
       ],
       "technicalNotes": [
-        "pricing_type field is present in the statuses[] array of delivered events as of July 1 2025",
