+      "description": "Rainbow AI uses markdown knowledge base files in .rainbow-kb/ and .rainbow-kb-southern/ that are manually updated. In production, stale KB content causes AI hallucinations where the bot quotes outdated room rates, menu prices, or policies. There is no mechanism to detect when source documents are out of date or alert an admin that re-ingestion is needed. This is distinct from the existing 'LLM response faithfulness check' which validates answers at inference time — this story addresses upstream data freshness.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "An AI System Scope document exists defining: what Rainbow AI does, what it does not do, affected parties (guests, staff), and deployment context",
