-        "The risk register is reviewed quarterly by a named responsible person",
-        "A responsible AI statement is published in the admin panel and referenced in the guest privacy notice"
+        "Each KB document has a last_verified_at timestamp stored in the rainbow_kb_files table",
+        "A configurable staleness threshold (default: 30 days) triggers an alert to the admin WhatsApp when any KB file has not been verified within that period",
+        "Admin can mark a KB file as 'verified' via the admin UI, resetting the staleness timer",
