+      "id": "US-1020",
+      "title": "WhatsApp delivery receipt pricing_type field ingestion for cost reconciliation",
       "priority": "medium",
-      "description": "WebAuthn Level 3 stabilised in Q1 2025 and passkey adoption became mainstream across major platforms in 2025. The Rainbow AI admin dashboard currently uses password-based sessions which are vulnerable to phishing and credential stuffing. Replacing or augmenting admin login with FIDO2 passkeys eliminates credential-theft risk — critical given the admin panel controls live WhatsApp messaging for hundreds of hostel guests and cafe customers.",
+      "description": "Meta's July 2025 pricing update added a new pricing_type sub-field to delivery receipt webhook status events indicating how a delivered message was billed (marketing, utility, authentication, service, or free). The existing cost tracker tallies estimated costs based on template category at send time but cannot reconcile against Meta's actual billed category, which may differ. Ingesting pricing_type from status webhooks enables accurate cost reconciliation.",
       "acceptanceCriteria": [
-        "Admin users can register a passkey (device biometric or hardware security key) from the Settings page; registration completes in under 10 seconds.",
-        "Passkey login flow completes authentication in under 3 seconds on a modern browser.",
-        "A TOTP (time-based OTP) fallback is available if passkey authentication fails or the registered device is unavailable.",
-        "Existing password-based sessions remain valid for 30 days post-launch, after which passkey or TOTP is required."
+        "The webhook status handler extracts pricing.pricing_type and pricing.billable from delivered message status events",
+        "The extracted pricing_type is stored against the message record in rainbow_messages",
+        "The cost dashboard shows both estimated cost (from send-time category) and actual billed category (from pricing_type); discrepancies are flagged",
+        "A monthly reconciliation report is available in admin UI showing total messages per actual billed category"
       ],
       "technicalNotes": [
-        "Use @simplewebauthn/server (Node.js) and @simplewebauthn/browser (front-end) packages.",
-        "Store passkey credential records in a new admin_passkeys table: fields credentialId, publicKey, counter, userId, createdAt.",
-        "Add /auth/passkey/register and /auth/passkey/authenticate routes in src/routes/admin/.",
-        "WebAuthn Level 3 spec W3C Working Draft published January 2025 — https://www.w3.org/TR/webauthn-3/"
+        "pricing_type field is present in the statuses[] array of delivered events as of July 1 2025",
